{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception interface, separating motion commands from sensor outcomes. The specification encodes safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is used in clear/search states, move_forward is used for short progress, and recovery turns are used after obstacles. Recovery is conservative and returns to exploration as soon as the path is clear. Full_rotate is only used as a last resort after repeated obstacles.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect open-loop actuation and asynchronous sensing.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, coverage-biased exploration: random_walk in clear, move_forward for short progress, conservative turn recovery after obstacles, and minimal use of full_rotate."
